<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Checkout Cancelled — LinguaLearn</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --white: #ffffff; --off-white: #f7f9fc; --ink: #0d1526; --muted: #7a87a0;
            --border: #e2e8f2; --blue: #2563eb; --blue-bg: #eff6ff;
            --radius: 12px; --radius-lg: 20px;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; background: var(--off-white);
            color: var(--ink); min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem;
        }

        .cancel-card {
            background: var(--white); border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
            max-width: 460px; width: 100%; text-align: center;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .cancel-card::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #94a3b8, #cbd5e1, #94a3b8);
        }

        .cancel-icon {
            font-size: 2.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            animation: fadeIn .5s ease both;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .cancel-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: .65rem;
            letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: .6rem;
        }
        .cancel-title {
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: .75rem;
        }
        .cancel-desc {
            font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .cancel-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; }

        .btn-primary {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem;
            padding: .85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); border: none;
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s, transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,.25);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #1d4ed8; transform: translateY(-1px); }

        .btn-ghost {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem;
            padding: .8rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted);
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .2s, color .2s, background .2s;
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue-bg); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="cancel-card">
        <div class="cancel-icon">😕</div>
        <div class="cancel-eyebrow">Checkout Cancelled</div>
        <h1 class="cancel-title">No charge was made</h1>
        <p class="cancel-desc">
            You've cancelled the checkout process. No payment has been taken.
            You can upgrade whenever you're ready — your progress is safe.
        </p>
        <div class="cancel-actions">
            <a href="{{ path('pricing') }}" class="btn-primary">View Plans →</a>
            <a href="{{ path('user_dashboard') }}" class="btn-ghost">Back to Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
